    <title>46.聊什么自制力，来磕cp</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afdb6a0a4a79edf137b59a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afdb6a0a4a79edf137b59a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:37:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：</span></p><ul><li><p><span>郑雨潇（@郑雨潇）</span></p></li><li><p><span>晨曦（@晨曦（脱口秀狂魔））</span></p></li><li><p><span>马小羊（@脱口秀马小羊）</span></p></li><li><p><span>姜小黑（@喜剧诗人姜小黑）</span></p></li><li><p><span>周溪（@孙答应）</span></p></li><li><p><span>昌叔（@搞笑的昌叔）</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>这期我们聊自制力</span></p><p><span>有人克制不住抽烟，有人克制不住打麻将，有人克制不住想你！</span></p><p><span>生活中处处是诱惑</span></p><p><span>就喜欢看点成双成对的故事，磕起cp也是忘情了，发恨了。。。</span></p><p></p><p><span>精彩时刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> – 郑雨潇被推举为全场自制力最强的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> – 郑雨潇医院见闻：晚上老有人来检查**功能</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> – 周溪戒烟翻车现场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> – 周溪过年偷烟被抓现行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> – 郑雨潇从180斤减到140斤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> – 周溪健身房写稿一个月瘦10斤直接内分泌失调</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> – 姜小黑的熬夜与耳鸣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> – 晨曦双拼焦虑爆发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> – 晨曦沙发上跟自己搏斗三个小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> – 昌叔偷偷打游戏被发现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> – 周溪坚持最久的坏习惯：从3岁开始不学习</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a> – 观众科普脱口秀圈CP</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3023">50:23</a> – 周溪成人泳道差点溺水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3361">56:01</a> – 马小羊麻将血泪史</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3851">1:04:11</a> – 姜小黑炒股「该割就割」</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkrn6EkF7I4niCDt33c-4TO_PZ7F.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsyXLAzgurE64m9vD2ixcnAkREUp.png"><p></p>]]></description>
