    <title>44.短暂但美好的相遇是一种奖励/惩罚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae9f57997726cd4675c49dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae9f57997726cd4675c49dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:11:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><p><span>本期主播：</span></p></li><li><p><span>黑灯（小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/7QcLtIhgcPe" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/o/7QcLtIhgcPe"><span>@黑灯</span></a><span>）</span></p></li><li><p><span>南瓜（小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/AVUoYPsP8wo" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/o/AVUoYPsP8wo"><span>@南瓜脱口秀</span></a><span>）</span></p></li><li><p><span>姜小黑（小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/4t2DWgHpRy4" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/o/4t2DWgHpRy4"><span>@喜剧诗人姜小黑</span></a><span>）</span></p></li><li><p><span>卡卡（小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/3WTVUTQ7E3D" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/o/3WTVUTQ7E3D"><span>@卡卡 脱口秀</span></a><span>）</span></p></li><li><p><span>昌叔（小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/o/4bf8ENoqkJY" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/o/4bf8ENoqkJY"><span>@搞笑的昌叔</span></a><span>）</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>【本期为小宇宙独家首发】10月22日-11月5日，小宇宙发起「喜剧播客抬杠大赛」特别企划</span></p><p><span>20+档喜剧播客在小宇宙接力更新，每期将围绕一个荒诞有趣的话题，带着不同立场互相“抬杠”</span></p><p><span>在小宇宙搜索「抬杠大赛」，一键追更！</span><a href="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/comedy-debate" data-url="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/comedy-debate"><span>h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUm_K1HxrnptrmHdsvnmF1exKAR.jpg"><p></p><p><span>这期我们聊聊相遇</span></p><p><span>短暂的相遇是奖励还是惩罚</span></p><p><span>我假装骑手去见你，你却让别人拿了外卖</span></p><p><span>我们只是在厕所偶遇，但你却想跟我聊天</span></p><p><span>曾经我们是搭档，后来你在商务舱，我在经济舱。我戴上了口罩，假装跟你擦肩而过</span></p><p><span>所以短暂的相遇可能对你是惩罚，但对别人是奖励！</span></p><p></p><p><span>精彩时刻精选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> – 嘉宾介绍 &amp; 互损开场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> – 昌叔黑灯澡堂被认出来的尴尬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> – 南瓜 &amp; 黑灯如何熟起来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> – 贤鱼在厕所也过于热情了吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> – 昌叔飞机偶遇***</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> – 卡卡超市遇“传销”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> – 南瓜跑腿往事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> – 主播童年执念大赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> – 卡卡现场唱歌翻车合集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> – 南瓜白月光蛋糕故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3920">1:05:20</a> – 姜小黑大学中二告白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">1:12:40</a> – 短暂的相遇是惩罚还是奖励？辩题大离谱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4890">1:21:30</a> – 昌叔浴场厕所差点被“奖励”</span></p><p></p><p><span>片尾曲-水星记</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujgRPrdWIwK4yUyxfjyp5J1Zd-S.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlYGd7V3opyxOFd_PZEjF31gdcBD.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOzqx5qYNGqgulC1fVtN8WY59Md.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fno4eKgQ555Za7xBLZ3A7UqOh6eb.png"><p></p>]]></description>
